Today is Thursday.
At five o'clock I leave the office.
At half past five is my badminton game.
I go straight to the sports club.
There I go near the counter.
I do not have a racket.
I say to the counter worker, "Sir, please give me a racket."
I take a racket on rent.
Amit and Neha are on the court.
They have already arrived.
Amit asks, "Maya, are you ready?"
I say, "Yes, I am fully ready to play."
"This week I have done a lot of work at the office."
"So I want to play well."
We play intensely.
I have played for one hour.
Right now I am very tired.
But I have left behind all the stress of the office.
We are all very happy.
